[[div class="templateInfo templateMargin"]]
**REMEMBER** -- Without a {{limit}} div, the {{anchor}} will remain present across the entire page content once you scroll past its starting position.
[[/div]]
[[div class="templateInfo"]]
[[# Misc]]
+++* 5. Miscellaneous Changeable Portions
----
If necessary, you can also edit any of these CSS properties to better suit your page.
[[/div]]
[[div class="templateInfo templateMargin"]]
+++++* Change Logo Opacity
----
[[div class="code terminal terminal--dark"]]
@@ @@##var(--c-symbol)|#extra-div-1##{
@@     @@##var(--c-builtin)|filter##: ##var(--c-builtin)|opacity##(##var(--c-value)|number_percentage##);
}
[[/div]]

= Default opacity = **33%**
[[/div]]
[[div class="templateInfo"]]
[[# TVars]]
+++* 6. Theme Variants
----
If you insert a different variable into the theme include block, you can apply a prefabricated theme variant to your page.
[[/div]]

[[module CSS]]
 .code.terminal:is(.variant, .subvariant) p {
    text-align: left;
}

 div.bookshelf {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column wrap;
    gap: 0 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
}

 div.bookshelf > * {
    flex-basis: 0;
}

 div.bookshelf > * > .image-container {
    padding: 0 0 .5rem;
}

 @media (max-width: 767.9px) {
     .code.terminal.variant p {
    	padding: 0;
    }
}

 @media (min-width: 768px) {
     .code.terminal.variant p {
    	padding: 0 7rem;
    }

     div.bookshelf {
    	flex-flow: row wrap;
    }

     div.bookshelf > * {
    	flex: 1 20.5rem;
    }
}
[[/module]]

@@ @@

