[[div class="hazard-box-image"]]
[[div class="hazard-box-image-6"]]
[[image https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/theme:flopstyle-dark/QQcBcvK.webp]]
[[/div]]
[[/div]]
[[div class="hazard-box-text"]]
+++* NARRATIVOHAZARD WARNING

The file you wish to access, “[[span style="font-family: var(--mono-font)"]]**SCP-████**[[/span]],” describes an unpredictable narrativic anomaly intersecting with multiple subnarrative layers. Narrativic inoculation is required, as this document contains several embedded narrativohazards. Personnel without inoculation against such anomalies may experience a narrative paraphrasing event.

Are you sure you wish to continue?
[[/div]]

[[/div]]

